# The Ancestral Mound (Crossroads_ShamanTemple): in at the left on the floor (x 0.5, y 7), along to the bench at x 15.09, sit and save.
at 0.5 8.4
walk 15.09
press up                                       # sit on the bench
wait until HK_BENCH_RESTS ge 1 timeout 600
wait 120
press cross                                    # get up
wait until HK_SAVE_WRITES ge 1 timeout 900     # the bench saves
wait 90
